.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH batten-engine-gate 1  batten 
.SH NAME
batten\-engine\-gate \- Refuse a source pin, or a release pin that cannot load this config or lacks a verb the released lanes call
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBbatten engine gate\fR [\fB\-\-lane\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Refuse a source pin, or a release pin that cannot load this config or lacks a verb the released lanes call
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lane\fR \fI<lane>\fR
A workflow that runs the released binary; every verb its command lines invoke must exist in the pinned release (repeatable)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
